https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111496","id":3392746289,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7KOTMx","user":{"login":"wareya","id":585488,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NTQ4OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/585488?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wareya","html_url":"https://github.com/wareya","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wareya/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wareya/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wareya/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wareya/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wareya/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wareya/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wareya/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wareya/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wareya/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-11T02:08:50Z","updated_at":"2025-10-11T02:08:50Z","body":"At the very least, invalid JSON shouldn't be generated, even if it changes the edge-case behavior for people misusing the JSONizer as a stringifier. Changing the output of `print(JSON.stringify(INF))` for example shouldn't be treated like a breaking change and I think replacing INFs with `[+-]1e99999` is totally OK and doing so is quasi-standard. Godot has made much more significant edge-case compatibility changes with much less development politicking hassle.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3392746289/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3392751524","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111496#is